## If you get stuck
- OOM with THOR at batch 32 → try `--xattn-heads 2` first, report memory before considering batch reduction
- THOR embeddings not on disk → STOP, report
- `training_params.txt` not writing new flags → fix before running training, not after
- n1 proxy at epoch 10 below 0.30 → STOP, something is wrong with vegboost integration
- Any NaN in loss → STOP, do not retry, report training curve and per-task loss breakdown